title KubeQuest - public lesson activity
start
:Choose a lesson about Little Notes;
:See the problem in plain English;
:Explore the labeled diagram;
:Predict what a change will do;
:Use browser simulation controls;
:Observe the response and explanation;
if (Want commands and YAML?) then (yes)
 :Open optional Go deeper panel;
endif
:Answer the understanding check;
while (Answer correct?) is (no)
 :Read the explanation;
 :Try another prediction;
 :Answer again;
endwhile (yes)
:Mark lesson complete;
:Write lesson ID to localStorage;
if (Authorized session?) then (yes)
 :Also save private lesson progress;
endif
:Continue or return later;
stop
